<title>USA: Pleasant Dale Park, Ill., won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Pleasant Dale Park, Ill., won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin, Kubik, Stephens &amp; Thompson, Inc., said it won $2.950 million of Pleasant Dale Park District, Ill., general obligation refunding bonds, series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.17 percent.</p>
</text>
